    "html": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" standalone=\"yes\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns:d=\"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/DictionaryService-1.0.rng\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" /></head><body><d:entry id=\"s_b-es-en0040662\" d:title=\"rendir\" class=\"entry\"><span class=\"hwg x_xh0\"><span d:dhw=\"1\" role=\"text\" frequent=\"y\" class=\"hw\">rendir </span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.001\" class=\"gramb x_xd0 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_gramb\">A </span><span d:pos=\"1\" class=\"ps\">transitive verb <d:pos></d:pos></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.002\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">1 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>homenaje<span class=\"gp tg_co\">, </span></span><span class=\"co\">tributo<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">to pay <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">rendían culto a la Virgen de Guadalupe </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">they worshipped the Virgin of Guadalupe</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">le rindieron honores militares </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">he was received with full military honors </span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.003\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">2 </span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.004\" class=\"semb x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">a </span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"fld\">Finance</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">to yield <d:def></d:def></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.005\" class=\"semb x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">b </span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"ind\"><span class=\"gp tg_ind\">(</span>producir<span class=\"gp tg_ind\">) </span></span><span class=\"trans\">to produce </span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd3 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">estos campos rinden mucha cebada </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd4\"><span class=\"trans\">these fields produce a lot of barley</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd3 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">el esfuerzo rindió sus frutos </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd4\"><span class=\"trans\">the effort bore fruit <span class=\"underline\">or</span> produced results </span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.006\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_semb\">3 </span><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>persona<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">me rindió el sueño </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">sleep overcame me<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"trans\">I was overcome by sleep</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">tanto trabajo rinde a cualquiera </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">working that hard is enough to exhaust anyone </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">working that hard is enough to wear anyone out <span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"lev\">informal</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.007\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">4 </span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.008\" class=\"semb x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">a </span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>informe<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">to present <d:def></d:def></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.009\" class=\"semb x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">b </span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"reg\">Southern Cone<span class=\"gp tg_reg\">, </span></span><span class=\"fld\">School<span class=\"gp tg_fld\">, </span></span><span class=\"fld\">University</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>examen<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span class=\"trans\">to take<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span></span><span class=\"trans\">to sit <span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"reg\">British English</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd3 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">tengo que <span class=\"rf\">rendir</span> geografía en marzo </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd4\"><span class=\"trans\">I have to take the geography exam in March </span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.010\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">5 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"reg\">Colombia</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span class=\"ind\"><span class=\"gp tg_ind\">(</span>diluir<span class=\"gp tg_ind\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">to dilute<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"trans\">to water down </span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.011\" class=\"gramb x_xd0 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_gramb\">B </span><span d:pos=\"2\" class=\"ps\">intransitive verb <d:pos></d:pos></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.012\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">1 </span><span class=\"exg x_xd2\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gr\"><span class=\"gp tg_gr\">(</span>+ me/te/le etc<span class=\"gp tg_gr\">) </span></span><span class=\"ind\"><span class=\"gp tg_ind\">(</span>cundir<span class=\"gp tg_ind\">) </span></span><span class=\"ex\">me rindió mucho la mañana </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span d:def=\"2\" class=\"trans\">I got a lot done this morning<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"trans\">I had a very productive morning</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">trabaja muchas horas pero no le rinde </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">he works hard but he doesn't make much headway <span class=\"underline\">or</span> he doesn't have much to show for it</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">¡que te rinda! </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">I hope it goes well<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span></span><span class=\"trans\">I hope you get a lot done </span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.013\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">2 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"cs\"><span class=\"gp tg_cs\">«</span>persona<span class=\"gp tg_cs\">» </span></span><span d:def=\"2\" class=\"trans\">to perform well<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"trans\">to get on well </span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">no rinde en los estudios </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">he's not getting on <span class=\"underline\">or</span> performing <span class=\"underline\">or</span> doing very well at school </span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.014\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">3 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"cs\"><span class=\"gp tg_cs\">«</span>tela<span class=\"gp tg_cs\">, </span></span><span class=\"cs\">arroz<span class=\"gp tg_cs\">, </span></span><span class=\"cs\">jabón<span class=\"gp tg_cs\">» </span></span><span d:def=\"2\" class=\"trans\">to go a long way <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">trata de hacerlo <span class=\"rf\">rendir </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">try to make it last </span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.015\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">4 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"reg\">River Plate<span class=\"gp tg_reg\">, </span></span><span class=\"fld\">School<span class=\"gp tg_fld\">, </span></span><span class=\"fld\">University</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"2\" class=\"trans\">to take an exam<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"trans\">to sit an exam <span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"reg\">British English</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.016\" class=\"gramb x_xd0 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_gramb\">C </span><span class=\"frmg\"><span class=\"gp tg_frmg\">(</span><span class=\"frm\">rendirse</span><span class=\"gp tg_frmg\">) </span></span><span d:pos=\"3\" class=\"ps\">pronominal verb <d:pos></d:pos></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.018\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">1 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"fld\">Military</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"3\" class=\"trans\">to surrender <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\"><span class=\"rf\">rendirse</span> al enemigo </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">to surrender to the enemy</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">seguiremos luchando por mejoras salariales, no nos <span class=\"rf\">rendiremos </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">we will continue to fight for better wages, we will not give in</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">tuvo que <span class=\"rf\">rendirse</span> ante la evidencia </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">she had to bow to <span class=\"underline\">or</span> accept the evidence </span></span></span></span><span id=\"s_b-es-en0040662.019\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">2 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"ind\"><span class=\"gp tg_ind\">(</span>en adivinanzas<span class=\"gp tg_ind\">) </span></span><span d:def=\"3\" class=\"trans\">to give up <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">me rindo, dime dónde lo has escondido </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">I give up, tell me where you've hidden it </span></span></span></span></span></d:entry></body></html>\n",
    "text": "rendir A transitive verb 1 ‹homenaje, tributo› to pay ▸ rendían culto a la Virgen de Guadalupe they worshipped the Virgin of Guadalupe▸ le rindieron honores militares he was received with full military honors 2 a (Finance) to yield b (producir) to produce ▸ estos campos rinden mucha cebada these fields produce a lot of barley▸ el esfuerzo rindió sus frutos the effort bore fruit or produced results 3 ‹persona› ▸ me rindió el sueño sleep overcame me, I was overcome by sleep▸ tanto trabajo rinde a cualquiera working that hard is enough to exhaust anyone working that hard is enough to wear anyone out (informal) 4 a ‹informe› to present b (Southern Cone, School, University) ‹examen› to take, to sit (British English) ▸ tengo que rendir geografía en marzo I have to take the geography exam in March 5 (Colombia) (diluir) to dilute, to water down B intransitive verb 1 (+ me/te/le etc) (cundir) me rindió mucho la mañana I got a lot done this morning, I had a very productive morning▸ trabaja muchas horas pero no le rinde he works hard but he doesn't make much headway or he doesn't have much to show for it▸ ¡que te rinda! I hope it goes well, I hope you get a lot done 2 «persona» to perform well, to get on well ▸ no rinde en los estudios he's not getting on or performing or doing very well at school 3 «tela, arroz, jabón» to go a long way ▸ trata de hacerlo rendir try to make it last 4 (River Plate, School, University) to take an exam, to sit an exam (British English) C (rendirse) pronominal verb 1 (Military) to surrender ▸ rendirse al enemigo to surrender to the enemy▸ seguiremos luchando por mejoras salariales, no nos rendiremos we will continue to fight for better wages, we will not give in▸ tuvo que rendirse ante la evidencia she had to bow to or accept the evidence 2 (en adivinanzas) to give up ▸ me rindo, dime dónde lo has escondido I give up, tell me where you've hidden it "
  }
